preprocessing, signature: the drop of take's operator()) of test.desc.
N5008 [temp.variadic]/5, [class.base.init]/7: __bind_back constructs
__bind_back_t through its inherited __perfect_forward_impl constructor,
whose mem-initializer builds tuple<_BoundArgs...> from the pack; the
tuple constructor's __base_ mem-initializer names four class types
computed from the packs.  The front end drops take's operator() and
reports CONVERSION ERROR.  clang++ 18 with libc++ accepts the program
(it uses clang's __make_integer_seq and __type_pack_element builtins,
which g++ does not have).  Pre-existing (fails on bin53).
